Version: 1.5.1~sigtest1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Experimental signal measurements and two-band LTE test with original-band recovery. Replaces public Dopamine BandLock temporarily and can interrupt cellular and emergency service. For controlled tester use only, not a stable release.
